class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">多输出回归</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">六项质量收率共同拟合</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">分类均值</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">轻重原料历史组成</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">闭合不等于准确裂化改变分子组成</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">组成约束</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">截零后归一为百分百</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">当前组成</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">六组分与汽油温度曲线</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">留出评价</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">每组分误差与逐批对照</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"对齐原料与操作批次：180个独立批次，126训练、54评价。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"55\" width=\"170\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">训练批次</text><path d=\"M185 85 L245 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M239 81L245 85L239 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"245\" y=\"55\" width=\"185\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"337.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">输入与同批测量</text><path d=\"M430 85 L490 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M484 81L490 85L484 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"490\" y=\"55\" width=\"220\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">留出批次另行评价</text></g></svg><figcaption>对齐原料与操作批次：180个独立批次，126训练、54评价。</figcaption></figure><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"学习六项产物关系：每次运行得到实际拟合的系数和组成预测。\"><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#233d46\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"55\" width=\"175\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"112.5\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">温度 / 操作 / 原料</text><path d=\"M200 85 L255 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M249 81L255 85L249 89\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"55\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e1efed\" stroke=\"#8eb4af\"/><text x=\"355.0\" y=\"91.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">拟合回归系数</text><path d=\"M455 85 L505 85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#377e7a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"